    "type": "game",
    "name": "They Feed Me Toothpaste",
    "steam_appid": 3789140,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>&quot;They Feed Me Toothpaste&quot; - A Psychological Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789140/extras/8dc12adf6bdc986c20896e252a797c04.avif?t=1753420625\" data-has-big width=800 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>James</strong> went to Silverpine Lake with his children to go fishing. He never thought ahead. Just made sure they were seated safely on the old rowboat. As long as they never made it back home... to see what he left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >James now wakes up in a sealed, unfamiliar room. On one wall: a gaping hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They call it <strong>The Mouth</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed it, and your remaining time goes down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat its food yourself, and time adds back on. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing you can eat? Toothpaste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon, others join you in the room.<br>You\u2019ll compete with them in twisted quizzes. Winners get toothpaste. Losers get nothing. Tensions rise. Trust collapses.<br><br><strong>You don't want to stay here with them for too long. You wonder, will time decrease if you feed 'The Mouth' human limbs?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789140/extras/202e0e1ebe6fe8bd7b4c2465ae173710.poster.avif?t=1753420625\" width=784 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789140/extras/202e0e1ebe6fe8bd7b4c2465ae173710.webm?t=1753420625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789140/extras/202e0e1ebe6fe8bd7b4c2465ae173710.mp4?t=1753420625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>They Feed Me Toothpaste</i></strong> is a narrative-driven walking simulator with a strong focus on psychological horror and character exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player, you won\u2019t just observe James\u2019s story. You\u2019ll piece it together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, you relive <strong>key moments from James\u2019s past</strong>, experiencing the slow, haunting build-up to his current imprisonment.<br><br>There must be a reason why the others got locked up as well, right? From time to time you'll get to relive their past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Time:</strong> About 3-4 hours of psychological gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quiz Time!</strong> Answer the questions correctly or no toothpaste for you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the horrible acts!</strong> You dive into the past of the other characters as they share their horrible stories to you!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision-Making:</strong> Every decision matters. There are no right or wrong answers... just blame the toothpaste.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluoride Toxicity:</strong> Eat too much toothpaste, and you might just get a deadly dose of fluoride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>&quot;They Feed Me Toothpaste&quot; - A Psychological Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789140/extras/8dc12adf6bdc986c20896e252a797c04.avif?t=1753420625\" data-has-big width=800 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>James</strong> went to Silverpine Lake with his children to go fishing. He never thought ahead. Just made sure they were seated safely on the old rowboat. As long as they never made it back home... to see what he left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >James now wakes up in a sealed, unfamiliar room. On one wall: a gaping hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They call it <strong>The Mouth</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed it, and your remaining time goes down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat its food yourself, and time adds back on. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing you can eat? Toothpaste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon, others join you in the room.<br>You\u2019ll compete with them in twisted quizzes. Winners get toothpaste. Losers get nothing. Tensions rise. Trust collapses.<br><br><strong>You don't want to stay here with them for too long. You wonder, will time decrease if you feed 'The Mouth' human limbs?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789140/extras/202e0e1ebe6fe8bd7b4c2465ae173710.poster.avif?t=1753420625\" width=784 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789140/extras/202e0e1ebe6fe8bd7b4c2465ae173710.webm?t=1753420625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789140/extras/202e0e1ebe6fe8bd7b4c2465ae173710.mp4?t=1753420625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>They Feed Me Toothpaste</i></strong> is a narrative-driven walking simulator with a strong focus on psychological horror and character exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player, you won\u2019t just observe James\u2019s story. You\u2019ll piece it together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, you relive <strong>key moments from James\u2019s past</strong>, experiencing the slow, haunting build-up to his current imprisonment.<br><br>There must be a reason why the others got locked up as well, right? From time to time you'll get to relive their past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Time:</strong> About 3-4 hours of psychological gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quiz Time!</strong> Answer the questions correctly or no toothpaste for you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the horrible acts!</strong> You dive into the past of the other characters as they share their horrible stories to you!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision-Making:</strong> Every decision matters. There are no right or wrong answers... just blame the toothpaste.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluoride Toxicity:</strong> Eat too much toothpaste, and you might just get a deadly dose of fluoride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You wake up in a locked room The only food is toothpaste. A giant Mouth in the wall eats everything else. Strangers appear. No one trusts anyone. Play quizzes. Win toothpaste! Decorate your room, because you're unsure how long you'll stay here. The Mouth is always hungry.",
